4'. barax(GUG2)-barax(GUG2) gal-gal-bi# zi# nu-mu-e-szi-pa-an#?-[...] 
#tr.en: Its great rulers do not breathe (anymore) because of you 
5'. szita2#!? an-na bala sa6-ga nu-kur2#-[...] 
